Thank you. Thank you.

00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:38.334
-She's...

00:00:38.334 --> 00:00:39.634
-Thank you. Thank you.

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.767
-Cher...
-Thank you.

00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:42.968
-What? What?
-What?

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:45.133
-What are you --
What are you doing here?

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:47.267
-Because -- Have you forgotten?

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:50.334
It's our 35th anniversary
of our show.

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:52.367
Is it thirty -- Wow. Already?

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:54.767
-Yeah. Oh, you guys probably
don't know this, but --

00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:57.334
