were on a show together.

00:00:57.334 --> 00:00:59.167
-Yeah, back in the day, we --

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:00.968
there was a show
called "Point..."

00:01:00.968 --> 00:01:02.234
Here. Come. Sit closer.
-Sorry.

00:01:02.234 --> 00:01:04.601
-There was a show called...

00:01:04.601 --> 00:01:06.400
-"Point Pleasant
Police Department."

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.834
-Yeah.
-And it took place in lovely

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:09.167
