00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:10.501
We played two detectives...
-Right.

00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:11.667
-...who couldn't see eye to eye.

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:12.968
We'd get in a lot of arguments.
-Yeah.

00:01:12.968 --> 00:01:14.133
Now, this sounds
like it's a joke,

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:15.467
but this was very serious.

00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:17.701
It was a serious show.
-It was a drama, yeah.

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:20.033
The two cops
would get pretty heated

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:22.367
and always seemed to end up
in messy situations.

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:23.634
Oh, my goodness.

00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:24.901
We actually have a clip
from one of the episodes.

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:26.501
-No!
-I'm just hearing. Yeah.

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:27.968
Let's take a look.

00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:30.267
