00:01:57.067 --> 00:01:59.133
-I am pretty...

00:01:59.133 --> 00:02:00.567
perturbed!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.400
But what's --
what's the problem?

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.300
-Well...

00:02:11.534 --> 00:02:14.968
-I put in a transfer because...

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:17.934
Lieu-- Lieutenant Palmer
promised to put me on probation

00:02:17.934 --> 00:02:22.133
if I'm not punctual!

00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:23.400
-P-Puh -- Puh --

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.634
-What? What? What?

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:27.801
No!

00:02:30.801 --> 00:02:32.400
-Don't be pugnacious!

00:02:34.234 --> 00:02:36.801
-Stop.
Would you like some oatmeal?

00:02:36.801 --> 00:02:40.267
-Well, you -- Oh, be careful.
[ Giggles ]

00:02:40.267 --> 00:02:43.501
Oh, no.
Don't be pugnacious, Pete!

00:02:43.501 --> 00:02:45.834
Oh.
-No. That's when you spit.

00:02:45.834 --> 00:02:47.133
You don't spit...

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.868 --> 00:02:54.701
♪♪

00:02:54.701 --> 00:02:58.501
♪♪

00:02:58.501 --> 00:03:00.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:04.534 --> 00:03:06.000
It's more intense
than I remember.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.534
I forgot that you --
I forgot now.

00:03:09.534 --> 00:03:11.801
Thinking back of the show,
I forgot your character

00:03:11.801 --> 00:03:14.334
had a mustache.

00:03:14.334 --> 00:03:15.934
I didn't know that.
-No, well...

00:03:15.934 --> 00:03:17.934
-I think someone
made a mistake maybe.

00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:20.334
-Uh, it was very in-your-face.

00:03:20.334 --> 00:03:22.868
-Actually, that was the slogan.
It was very in-your-face.

00:03:22.868 --> 00:03:24.701
I'm hearing we have
another clip.

00:03:24.701 --> 00:03:26.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.434 --> 00:03:28.501
From the same episode?

00:03:28.501 --> 00:03:30.133
Check this out.

00:03:30.133 --> 00:03:32.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:32.467 --> 00:03:37.234
♪♪

00:03:37.234 --> 00:03:41.968
♪♪

00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:45.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:45.234 --> 00:03:46.534
-Pete!

00:03:48.434 --> 00:03:51.434
I'm in a...

00:03:51.434 --> 00:03:52.734
pretty...

00:03:56.501 --> 00:03:57.634
...pickle!

00:03:57.634 --> 00:03:59.934
[ Laughs ]

00:03:59.934 --> 00:04:02.367
No, I'm in a pretty pickle,
Pete!

00:04:02.367 --> 00:04:03.601
-Why?
-Because I heard

00:04:03.601 --> 00:04:05.934
you're pretty passionate.

00:04:05.934 --> 00:04:08.000
-Yeah. What?

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.701
-And I'm pregnant!

00:04:11.968 --> 00:04:14.601
And you're gonna
have to take a...

00:04:14.601 --> 00:04:17.234
paternity test...

00:04:17.234 --> 00:04:19.000
to prove -- Oh, [bleep]

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.167
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.334 --> 00:04:24.100
-Stop.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:27.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:27.534 --> 00:04:30.567
You keep the language up.
this show's gonna get canceled!

00:04:30.567 --> 00:04:32.767
-Um...

00:04:32.767 --> 00:04:36.167
-I'm positive I'm not the papa!

00:04:38.701 --> 00:04:41.567
-Pipe down! Pete!

00:04:42.834 --> 00:04:44.000
