00:05:43.734 --> 00:05:45.467
-I could almost taste it.

00:05:45.467 --> 00:05:48.968
[ Laughter ]

00:05:48.968 --> 00:05:50.400
-Oh, you're kidding me.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:51.667
