-Okay.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:10.634 --> 00:06:16.033
♪♪

00:06:16.033 --> 00:06:21.467
♪♪

00:06:21.467 --> 00:06:23.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:23.167 --> 00:06:24.467
-Yeah.

00:06:24.467 --> 00:06:26.467
Another successful year of...

00:06:26.467 --> 00:06:28.701
