00:06:28.701 --> 00:06:30.567
-I'm no prognosticator.

00:06:30.567 --> 00:06:32.667
[ Laughter ]

00:06:32.667 --> 00:06:34.400
But I'm...

00:06:36.434 --> 00:06:39.067
You pricked your finger?

00:06:39.067 --> 00:06:40.467
-Yeah. I did.

00:06:40.467 --> 00:06:41.634
-Your little pinky?!

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:45.934
[ Cher laughing ]

00:06:45.934 --> 00:06:47.167
-Mm-hmm.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.601
Mm-hmm.
-Uh-huh.

00:06:50.667 --> 00:06:51.968
-Mm-hmm.
-Okay.

00:06:52.033 --> 00:06:53.133
-Mm-hmm.
-Alright.

00:06:53.133 --> 00:06:54.734
-[ Shouting ]
-[ Shrieks ]

00:06:54.734 --> 00:06:56.400
[ Cher laughing ]

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:59.000
-Ooh.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.033
