my 'stache there.

00:07:01.033 --> 00:07:02.834
-I know.
-Yeah, I --

00:07:05.167 --> 00:07:06.634
-Pretty.

00:07:06.634 --> 00:07:08.868
-[ Stammering ]

00:07:08.868 --> 00:07:11.400
That sounded like it started
with the letter "B" there.

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:12.601
I didn't...
-Mnh-mnh.

00:07:12.601 --> 00:07:14.334
-No? It wasn't "B"?

00:07:14.334 --> 00:07:16.400
-Pretty.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:19.033
It was --
It was, um, parfait.

00:07:19.033 --> 00:07:20.400
