00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.634
-I just want to say...

00:07:21.634 --> 00:07:23.000
-What?

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:27.868
-I think you're perfect!

00:07:29.434 --> 00:07:34.300
-And I think
you're perfect, too!

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:35.968
-Merry Christmas, partner!

00:07:35.968 --> 00:07:37.467
I'm glad we're part of the...

00:07:37.467 --> 00:07:39.567
Point Pleasant
police Department!

00:07:39.567 --> 00:07:41.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:41.467 --> 00:07:46.934
♪♪

00:07:46.934 --> 00:07:50.400
Pretty good policemen.
-I'm proud of the performance.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.267
-My thanks to Cher, everybody.

00:07:52.267 --> 00:07:55.601
Her album, "Christmas"
is available everywhere now!

00:07:55.601 --> 00:07:58.133
Stick around. We'll be right
back with more "Tonight Show."

